          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I identified manufacturing order **MO-25-09-1070** and confirmed that September entered Pending Close at **2025-09-30T18:00:00**. The records available to my analyst role contain no cost-event rows. I’ll request an authorized event extract so I can verify the transaction, amount, creation time, and accounting status without accessing restricted data or changing records.",
